[size=3][b]GitHub: [url=https://github.com/damiansirbu-stalker/Hideout-Furniture-Infinite-Fuel]https://github.com/damiansirbu-stalker/Hideout-Furniture-Infinite-Fuel[/url][/b][/size]
[size=3][b]Changelog: [url=https://github.com/damiansirbu-stalker/Hideout-Furniture-Infinite-Fuel/blob/main/doc/changelog]doc/changelog[/url][/b][/size]

Removes fuel and battery consumption from all placeable light furniture.
Lights no longer require batteries, kerosene, or gauss ammo to operate.

One script change: bind_light_furniture.script line 88, self.infinite_fuel = true instead of checking world object status.
All visual effects, sounds, flickering, and toggle behavior are preserved.

[line]

[size=3][b]Features[/b][/size]

[size=2][b]Affected items:[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Metal Torch[/b] (was: batteries_dead, 800h)
[*][b]Gas Lamp[/b] (was: kerosene, 1200h)
[*][b]Gas Lamp GAMMA variant[/b] (was: kerosene, 99999h)
[*][b]Light Altar[/b] (was: ammo_gauss, 2400h)
[/list]

All other furniture (workshop, radio, displays, stashes) does not consume fuel and is unaffected.

[line]

[size=3][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Anomaly 1.5.3
[*]Modded exes
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stalkeranomaly/mods/102]xlibs[/url]
[*]Hideout Furniture by Aoldri (provides bind_hf_base.script)
[/list]

[line]

[size=3][b]Install (MO2)[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]1. Install Hideout Furniture by Aoldri
[*]2. Install this mod
[*]3. Must load AFTER Hideout Furniture and any Hideout Furniture patches
[/list]

[line]

[size=3][b]Uninstall (MO2)[/b][/size]
Disable or remove in MO2.

[line]

[size=3][b]Compatibility[/b][/size]
Requires xlibs.
Runs on themrdemonized modded exes 2025.9.10 or newer, or AOEngine v0.55 or newer.
The full feature set needs the latest demonized build. A feature that needs a newer build stays inactive on older exes.
Simple file replacement (not DLTX). Overrides bind_light_furniture.script.
Works with Hideout Furniture by Aoldri, SixSloth's & Veerserif's Hideout Furnitures, Even More Hideout Furnitures, Hideout Furniture Expansion, G.A.M.M.A. Light Sources Spawner.

[line]

[size=3][b]FAQ[/b][/size]

[b]Do I need modded exes?[/b]
Yes. Hideout Furniture Infinite Fuel needs themrdemonized modded exes (2025.9.10 or newer) or AOEngine (v0.55 or newer). Vanilla Anomaly does not expose the APIs it relies on.

[size=3][b]Credits[/b][/size]
DrakoMT and SaloEater for their support.
Demonized, Catspaw, Vintar0, RavenAscendant, xcvb, lizzardman, Aoldri, and Feel_Fried. Their work on the engine, modded exes, scripts, and tools shaped how Anomaly modding is done.

[line]

[size=3][b]Development[/b][/size]
Original mod by Aoldri. This is a one-line patch.

[line]

[size=3][b]Usage and License[/b][/size]
Modpacks: allowed and encouraged. Keep the readme and license files.
Addons, patches, integrations: allowed. Credit "Hideout Furniture Infinite Fuel by Damian Sirbu" visibly on your mod page.
Reproducing the implementation in other software: not allowed, even with credit.
Full license in LICENSE file and on GitHub.

[line]


[size=3][b]Reporting issues and suggestions[/b][/size]
Open a bug report or a suggestion at https://github.com/damiansirbu-stalker/Hideout-Furniture-Infinite-Fuel/issues/new/choose.
Also discussed on the GAMMA, EFP, Anomaly, and Zona Discord servers.

Before posting, read this readme.

Include:
[list]
[*]Exact steps to reproduce, from a new game or a named save, with expected and actual result.
[*]xray.log, plus engine build, modlist, load order.
[*]Describe the behavior. With hundreds of mods and overrides, only the log shows whether this mod was involved and what caused it.
[/list]
